# Ecommerce Expo booth

This workspace is the **Ecommerce Expo** cut of the Uploadcare TV booth deck.
It started as a clone of the latest Webflow Conf / booth project.

## Isolation

- Do **not** edit `../UC-slides/uploadcare-show` from this chat. That is the
  Webflow Conf project.
- Do **not** push to the Webflow Conf remote. This clone has no `origin` until
  a dedicated Ecommerce Expo remote is added.
- Treat Webflow-specific copy, QR, and marketplace cards as **inherited
  placeholders** until the user replaces them with Expo context.

## Build rules (unchanged)

- Edit `src/*.template.html` and `assets/`. Never hand-edit `dist/`.
- Rebuild with `python build.py` / `python build_simple.py` after source changes.
- Prefer the simple 7-card booth loop (`src/simple.template.html`) unless asked
  for the full deck.

## Event context

Read `EVENT.md` for confirmed vs TBD notes. When the user adds Expo copy,
storyboard, QR, or giveaway details, update `EVENT.md` and the deck — do not
invent event facts.
